250 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 202 0 R
/E (Sovereignty is the supreme, absolute, and independent authority of a State to govern itself, make laws and control its territory without outside interference. It encompasses both internal supremacy \(i.e. controlling domestic affairs\) and external independence \(i.e. acting autonomously in international relations\).)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
