/P 202 0 R
/E (We are talking here about Scottish sovereignty and the ability of the Scottish people to govern themselves.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
253 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 202 0 R
/E (We must therefore remember that when we are talking about the sovereignty of the Scottish people and the recognition by other countries that Scotland has an inalienable right to govern itself and be recognized by other nations as completely independent. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
