255 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 203 0 R
/E (Support for Scottish Independence continues to grow. Scots are waking up to the grim realities of being a stateless nation. We see the UK failing, and we are waking up to the reality that for us, as a people, independence is an existential matter.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
256 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 203 0 R
/E (So, we would like to take you on a journey. A journey from the grim realities of a failing UK to a vision for a future Scotland that puts the Scottish people first.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
