/P 203 0 R
/E (We stand for a sovereign Scotland, for real independence from both the United Kingdom and European Union. Sovereignty resolve that it is not in the gift of any political party, prior to a definitive vote for full Independence, to decide, or promote what organisations the free people of Scotland might later join.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [8]
