/S /P
/P 209 0 R
/E (While we want to see the resource extraction and service sectors thrive, industry and manufacturing should once again lie at the heart of economic policy. We have outsourced food production, energy, and industrial capacity, and exported jobs elsewhere. Covid and the Iran War shows that we need to be as close to self-reliance as possible. )
