/S /P
/P 210 0 R
/E (We will encourage entrepreneurship, but encourage entrepreneurs to grow businesses for the benefit of the Scottish people, with a social purpose in mind. With independence, we will be able to stop our retail and care sectors being used as a front for bypassing immigration controls.)
