/S /P
/P 210 0 R
/E (We will consider introducing an Annual Ground Rent \(AGR\), also known as a Land Value Tax, to ensure that large landowners pay their fair share. We will active investigate replacing council tax and business rates with the AGR, ensuring more affordable homes and a fairer taxation system overall. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
329 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 210 0 R
/E (Furthermore, by reviewing Land and Buildings Transaction Tax \(LBTT\) rates, we will work to increase transactions in land back to a level more indicative of land being put to productive use. This will benefit users of land, not holders of it. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [3]
>>
