/S /P
/P 213 0 R
/E (We will revoke the forthcoming ban on internal combustion engines \(ICE\), end carbon credits that enrich the elite, and oppose Low Emission Zones \(LEZs\) and Ultra Low Emission Zones \(ULEZs\) as a tax on the poor, destroying livelihoods and displacing pollution without real benefit.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [9]
>>
